{"id":"5f28c17da801f47c","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-homotopy-category.md","title":"Homotopy Category","display":"df-homotopy-category — Homotopy Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homotopy-category","aliases":["58-df-homotopy-category","Homotopy Category"],"display":"df-homotopy-category — Homotopy Category","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homotopy-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homotopy-category</span><span>Homotopy Category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homotopy-category — Homotopy Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md\">../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Top}\">\\(\\mathbf{Top}\\)</span> is the category of topological spaces and continuous maps.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf X=(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\mathbf X=(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf Y=(Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\(\\mathbf Y=(Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span> are objects of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Top}\">\\(\\mathbf{Top}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A set-coded category is unpacked as\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle O_{\\mathcal C},M_{\\mathcal C},s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle O_{\\mathcal C},M_{\\mathcal C},s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},c_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\)</span>;\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}\\)</span> are the decoding operations defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" href=\"?note=cc1ce993dd3ce56d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md\">../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomotopyCategory}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HomotopyCategory}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}object\\text{-}hom\\text{-}decoding}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathcal C=\n\\langle O_{\\mathcal C},M_{\\mathcal C},s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\nc_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\left[\n\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)=O_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\forall A,B\\in O_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)=\n\\{f\\in M_{\\mathcal C}:s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=B\\}\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}object\\text{-}hom\\text{-}decoding}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathcal C=\n\\langle O_{\\mathcal C},M_{\\mathcal C},s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\nc_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\left[\n\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)=O_{\\mathcal C}\n\\land\\forall A,B\\in O_{\\mathcal C}\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)=\n\\{f\\in M_{\\mathcal C}:s_{\\mathcal C}(f)=A\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(f)=B\\}\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomotopyCategory}_S(\\mathbf{hTop},\\mathbf{Top})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathbf{Top})\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathbf{hTop})\n\\land\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{hTop})=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Top})\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf X,\\mathbf Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Top})\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbf{hTop}}(\\mathbf X,\\mathbf Y)\n=\n\\frac{\n\\{f\\in Y^X:\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\}\n}{\nf\\sim g\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(f,g,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n}\n\\land [g]\\circ[f]=[g\\circ f].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homotopy\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomotopyCategory}_S(\\mathbf{hTop},\\mathbf{Top})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathbf{Top})\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathbf{hTop})\n\\land\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{hTop})=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Top})\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf X,\\mathbf Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Top})\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbf{hTop}}(\\mathbf X,\\mathbf Y)\n=\n\\frac{\n\\{f\\in Y^X:\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\}\n}{\nf\\sim g\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{Homotopic}_S(f,g,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\n}\n\\land [g]\\circ[f]=[g\\circ f].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom defines the ordinary homotopy category with homotopy classes of continuous maps.</li>\n<li>The Quillen homotopy category obtained by localizing at weak homotopy equivalences is a related but distinct construction; the former file conflated the two.</li>\n<li>Pointed homotopy groups require pointed maps and based homotopies, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_n(X)=[S^n,X]\">\\(\\pi_n(X)=[S^n,X]\\)</span> is not an unqualified clause of this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>May, A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md","status":"resolved","id":"cc1ce993dd3ce56d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-homotopy.md]]","embed":fa